    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="16.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hl">Hl</ref> 16.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he þanne þæt ne mæge gecyþan mid rihtre canne, læte þanne án, ⁊ se agend tofó.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he cannot then declare that by lawful cognizance, let him then relinquish [it], and the owner take possession.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he þanne þæt ne mæge gecyþan mid rihtre canne, læte þanne án, ⁊ se agend tofó.</ab>
